m&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-FzyXuNcGQpxcqrPYWzy2hayhtDr79r0ne_rNqbE37Ww&oe=6A3941B5"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2025-02-17 131522_2k.png", "id": "1546603122654497", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391858_1546603125987830_8738673988552125925_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a-oJhMEJSuwQ7kNvwFSI9YQ&_nc_oc=Adp_mi_Yq2VfdyKbKV68yy-NW6ASiPYlHkjC2nW9_Z-xyv3gAbtGx5_Q2etIfYUDueg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-2KF_Vu9cdXLmWmmliiXHV-iU-OaRs9wlU21PIw1_I5Q&oe=6A394320"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2025-02-17 131741_2k.png", "id": "1554063308618762", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391932_1554063311952095_3766067680403299101_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u3oNbkk00vMQ7kNvwEO7wDs&_nc_oc=AdqnFqfmrJBmQWFVoMFo8X5LjjOxaRNLgyFKX3IoCJHhmn9wBAWdmVQKggsMggaDyQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af851b0AadAuGxpxQIaHdCke51ihx1oka96vYluexnGqAA&oe=6A395E85"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2025-02-17 131908_2k.png", "id": "28598092149837316", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391923_28598092159837315_2688211521149680504_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r6auD7bDKkQQ7kNvwFDOKwj&_nc_oc=AdrCCssvQR6X_zQFEunzCSahgyG1Yh8DdQDRaa0CozVKuSiH869WsIf_OVbwr48HjOc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Bl5mMT1oIypWT1zZ6c0OUwelhqNjo7XES14j2mFCUvQ&oe=6A394077"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ToujoursDimanche_SuperSublime_Trailer01Cover_22-12-01.png", "id": "759567802054587", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974871_759567805387920_1842196776566338613_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uw1_PknmqhcQ7kNvwGvaqO1&_nc_oc=AdrD8qk6Npyo42-p8fgb8GH6BZRErCZqKckL9gzZ8KSCP81RQVvE_HK_ixeOj7FXNLI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-seYuoyNRiX5nlGfvOYwKiHksNNpSReMBTLUjVTQAfIA&oe=6A3961CF"}, "display_name": "Toujours Dimanche III", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Toujours Dimanche brings nature to those who can\u2019t access it.\nSplurge into sunsets, take a break by the sea, explore a mountain ridge, or listen to crickets... Enjoy the beauty of nature as you will.\n\nThere are may ways to enjoy our app. Either browse the sites gallery, explore a world map, or engage in a guided meditation. You can also either enjoy a contemplative beat, or explore areas in a more adventurous way. \n\nWhile appealing to travel and nature enthusiasts, Toujours Dimanche was developped in collaboration with health-care partners. It is designed especially for nursing homes, retirement homes & pallaitive care. It's safe, confortable and accessible. We take pride at creating useful immersive tools for health care professionals.\n\nA non-VR versions for Mobile (iOS/Android) is also available and can be used to assist less-able, VR users. This way, anyone using a mobile device can become \"the guide\" and assist other users, for accessibility purpose.\n\nSuper Sublime is a non for profit organisation with a mission to alleviate pain and lift-up spirits through art & immersion. We created Toujours Dimanche with a goodwill intent. Becasue we think Nature is a basic need for anyone, no matter your priviledges of luck in life.", "short_description": "Toujours Dimanche brings nature to those who can\u2019t access it.\nSplurge into sunsets, take a break by the sea, explore a mountain ridge, or listen to crickets... Enjoy the beauty of nature as you will.\n\nDevelopped in collaboration with health-care partners, this app is designed especially for nursing homes, retirement homes & pallaitive care. It offers both relaxing and stimulating sessions. It's safe, confortable and accessible. Toujours Dimanche was made with a non for profit, goodwill intent."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.supersublime.org/toujours-dimanche-privacy-policy", "d